        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic three-bedroom, three-bathroom family home to the rental market in the highly sought-after development of The Way, Hunter's Run, Clonee, Dublin 15.\nHunter's Run is ideally located close to a host of local amenities including schools, shops, restaurants, and leisure facilities. Clonee Village, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, and the N3/M50 road networks are all within easy reach, while excellent public transport links provide quick access to Dublin City Centre.\nBright and spacious living accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, downstairs toilet, a large living room, and an open-plan kitchen/dining area with fully fitted kitchen and direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs boasts three generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a fully tiled family bathroom.\nTo the rear is a private, low-maintenance garden, while the front offers off-street parking. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this superb home is sure to appeal to a wide range of tenants. Early viewing is highly recommended. Contact Ray Cooke Lettings today to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 3 bed / 3 bath\n- Semi-detached house\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Luxurious modern fitted wardrobes\n- Top quality blinds\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Overlooking green area\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Integrated appliances\n- Ample additional storage\n- Downstairs toilet, main bathroom and master ensuite\n- Generous rear garden\n- Private enclosed rear garden\n- Low maintenance rear garden\n- Peaceful location\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
